'' A RESOURCE SCRIPT IS WINDOWS-ONLY, and saying so beats ignoring it. There is
'' nothing to link a .rc into on ELF, so a build that quietly dropped it would put
'' out a binary missing whatever the script carried.
''
'' The target is named in ARGS because tests/driver has no TARGETS file and the
'' runner otherwise prepends win64.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target linux-x86_64 tests/driver/src/res.bas tests/driver/src/res.rc -o tests/driver/res-linux.out
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: TKO0108
'' EXPECT-OUT: is a Windows resource script
'' EXPECT-NO-FILE: tests/driver/res-linux.out
